`src.featured load 7` returning [] and `src.featured classify` returning
"different" for all 5 finalists) ===

1. Cisco IOS XR/Nexus critical bundle (items 29, 69-75; 8 items)
   diversity(news+nvd, 2 families)=2.20, recency(~2.7h)=1.34,
   severity(CVSS 9.8 present -> +1.0)=1.00, vendor_match(Cisco)=1.50
   ~= 6.3-6.5 total. Highest score. #1 pick.

2. HiddenLayer $100M funding (items 25, 38)
   diversity(news,1 family)=1.39, recency(~0.9h)=1.45,
   vendor_match(HiddenLayer)=1.50, commercial_signal("raises $" match)=1.25
   ~= 5.6. #2 pick.

3. SonicWall SMA 1000 zero-day + CISA KEV (items 20, 12)
   diversity(news,1 family)=1.39, recency(~7.9h)=1.08,
   severity(CVSS 10.0 + "zero-day" phrase)=1.50, vendor_match(SonicWall)=1.50
   ~= 5.5. #3 pick.

4. Thomson Reuters court-data breach (item 39, single source)
   diversity=1.39, recency(~1.2h)=1.43, brand_breach(named victim)=2.00
